# systemd journald message catalog for component: database_manager

-- 4c8a1023e5b94d719f012a34c8b5e101
Subject: Database initialization failure caught at component boundary
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::database_manager
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The database_store::initialize boundary proxy caught an exception from internal
initialization because the supplied path was empty or an existing database file
could not be parsed.

-- 4c8a1023e5b94d719f012a34c8b5e102
Subject: Item insertion failure caught at component boundary
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::database_manager
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The database_store::add_item boundary proxy caught an exception from internal
validation or storage because the required id field was empty or memory
allocation failed.

-- 4c8a1023e5b94d719f012a34c8b5e103
Subject: Database serialization failure caught at component boundary
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::database_manager
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The database_store::save_to boundary proxy caught an exception during internal
Protobuf snapshot persistence because the parent directory does not exist,
lacks write permission, or failed during stream serialization.

-- 4c8a1023e5b94d719f012a34c8b5e104
Subject: Database deserialization failure caught at component boundary
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::database_manager
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The database_store::load boundary proxy caught an exception when internal file
deserialization encountered a corrupted or unreadable Protobuf file on disk.
